{"id": "clyb-taylor-flow", "name": "Clyb Taylor flow", "family": "sampler", "subfamily": "Clybius Chroma samplers", "plain": "Multistep Euler in lerp form with a polynomial correction from up to 8 past x0 values. Coefficients come from a Vandermonde system in sigma differences. Includes four ways to split \u03c3\u2193 and \u03c3\u2191.", "math": "R[m,i]=(\u03c3_m\u2212\u03c3_ref)^i. C_i=h\u2071\u207a\u00b9/(i+1), h=\u03c3_next\u2212\u03c3_cur. Solve R\u00b7B\u2248C by default with diagonal regularisation.\nD_m=x0_m\u2212x0_cur. x_next=lerp(x,x0_cur,1\u2212\u03c3\u2193/\u03c3_cur)+\u03a3 B_m\u00b7D_m.\n\u03c3_calc: clyb, taylor-expansion, ancestral, adaptive (variance of recent x0 lowers \u03c3\u2193). Noise as Clyb BDF.", "props": {"order": "history up to order=8", "stages": 1, "stochastic": "ancestral", "multistep": true, "prediction_space": "x0 in \u03c3; flow branch on CONST"}, "evidence": [{"where": "Clybius__ComfyUI-ClybsChromaNodes/clyb_Samplers.py:211", "symbol": "sampler_taylor_flow"}, {"where": "Clybius__ComfyUI-ClybsChromaNodes/clyb_Samplers.py:94", "symbol": "_construct_vandermonde_flow"}, {"where": "Clybius__ComfyUI-ClybsChromaNodes/clyb_Samplers.py:127", "symbol": "_solve_flow_coefficients"}], "providers": [{"pack": "Clybius__ComfyUI-ClybsChromaNodes", "author": "Clybius", "licence": "Apache-2.0", "kind": "original", "nodes": ["SamplerTaylorFlow"], "note": "", "verdict": "TRY", "risks": [], "res4lyf": false}], "providers_n": 1, "in_core": false, "live": false, "needs_pack": true, "core_ref": {}, "family_fit": [{"family": "flow-matching", "why": "Branch on CONST", "label": "from code", "source": "Clybius__ComfyUI-ClybsChromaNodes/clyb_Samplers.py:400"}], "claims": [], "label": "from code", "surprise": "", "rendered": false, "rendered_ids": [], "risks": [], "flagged_providers": 0, "licences": ["Apache-2.0"], "verdicts": ["TRY"], "audit": null, "run_patch": "", "run_guider": "", "prefer_model": ""}